  "multiplicity": "Only one primary estimand (D_real's effect on change in PPP, controlling for L) will be tested. Any exploratory analyses of different definitions of 'reorganization relative to L' (e.g., D_real - L) will be clearly labeled as such and adjusted for multiple comparisons if formally tested.",
